{
"body": "Between approximately 9:42 AM and 10:38 AM ET on April 10, we observed delivery failures for customers in the US1, AP1, and AP2 regions. During this window, notifications to the following integrations were delayed or temporarily undelivered:\n\n\u2022 PagerDuty\n\u2022 Slack\n\u2022 Microsoft Teams\n\u2022 Webhooks\n\u2022 Jira\n\u2022 ServiceNow\n\u2022 OpsGenie\n\u2022 VictorOps\n\u2022 BigPanda\n\u2022 Zendesk\n\u2022 Sumologic\n\nAll delayed notifications have been replayed with the following exceptions: PagerDuty pages and Slack notifications queued during the outage window were not replayed, as they were no longer actionable at the time of recovery. Webhook notifications will be reprocessed and delivered at a later date.\n\nNo monitoring data was lost during this incident. Monitor evaluations continued normally \u2014 only the delivery of triggered notifications was affected.\n\nThank you for your patience.",
"first_seen": "2026-09-04T07:06:16Z",
"impact": "major",
"last_seen": "2026-09-08T12:29:58Z",
"resolved_at": "2026-04-10T16:59:49.000-04:00",
"resolved_inferred": false,
"started_at": "2026-04-10T10:54:11.000-04:00",
"state": "resolved",
"title": "Notifications to Pagerduty, VictorOps, Slack, Webhook, Microsoft Teams and OpsGenie are not delivered",
"updated_at": "2026-04-10T17:14:38.535-04:00",
"url": "https://stspg.io/18986pkc2dgr"
},
